# Linux/WSL2 package manifest, rendered into ~/Brewfile by Brewfile.tmpl.
#
# Converted from the retired brew-formula-wsl2.txt + brew-trust-taps.txt, so
# it carries every tap the old brew_trust_taps pass added even though only
# terraform, k9s and protolint need one. Running generate-brewfile.sh on an
# actual WSL2 box replaces this with a real `brew bundle dump`, which prunes
# the unused taps and adds the description comments.
